{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/1413759-2e-abyssals-and-their-military-commanders","id":1413759,"title":"2e Abyssals and their military commanders","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Abyssal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-09-15T05:58:31-07:00","id":1413759,"title":"2e Abyssals and their military commanders","content":"I've been looking at the mass combat rules and was considering them as it applies to having troops of undead. Since in mass combat the commander &quot;wears&quot; their unit, adding bonuses to the commander's stats I am looking for good commanders to lead those undead troops. So how would you get some good unit commanders?<br /> <br /> Deathknights need unit commanders, whether the operation requires a fang or two dragons of troops. But I'm not seeing a lot of good choices for Deathknight to select from when looking for unit commanders. Can anyone suggest good unit types?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3814-g3taso","name":"g3taso","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3814_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-15T06:40:13-07:00","id":1413762,"title":"","content":"Necromancy lets you build your own, with the 2nd circle. Living commanders (ghost bloods) offer some options, as do nemissaries. Both of those (and heroic ghosts) are probably your best answers, but it takes about as much effort as recruiting skilled mortal commanders.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26421-scrollreader","name":"Scrollreader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26421_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-09-15T09:05:58-07:00","id":1413788,"title":"","content":"Look at the Abyssal War charm Hive Mind Horror Tactics. This charm removed the need for relays. So that may be a help too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3012-uknown-darklord","name":"Uknown DarkLord","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3012_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"485"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-20T06:02:20-08:00","id":1500836,"title":"","content":"Nemissaries and Nephwracks immediately come to mind.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}